  "body": "* North-east aspect with expansive views\r\n* Walk to Orewa Beach, shops, cafes, restaurants, supermarkets\r\n* Views across Alice Eaves Bush to the sea and beyond\r\n* 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, light-filled and peaceful\r\n* Modern kitchen with stone island bench\r\n* Covered deck with outstanding views\r\n* Internal access garage plus lock-up storage\r\n* Heated pool, gym, sauna and 10 acres of park-like grounds\r\n\r\nA home that must be sold.\r\nWith a commanding north-east aspect.\r\nPrivate, quiet, and with outstanding views.\r\nAcross to Alice Eaves Bush, out to sea and beyond.\r\nWith so much sun!\r\nTwo bedrooms, two bathrooms.\r\nRoom for guests, space for connecting.\r\nReady to be yours.\r\n\r\nThe bush, beautiful and re-energising, is literally right there.\r\nGlistening every morning.\r\nThere is a fantastic, covered outdoor entertainer's deck where you can relax all day.\r\nMorning coffee in the sun, afternoon refreshments in the shade.\r\n\r\nInside, at the heart of the home is the beautiful modern kitchen.\r\nWith a Fisher and Paykel oven, Smeg induction cooktop, high-quality stone composite island bench and oodles of storage.\r\nThere is a Fujitsu heat pump and a big hot water cupboard.\r\nThe home is double-glazed.\r\nThere is also an internal access garage with a dedicated parking space, and an additional lock-up storage space for bikes, and tools, and extra items.\r\n\r\nIt's easy to see why this part of the coast is such a popular place to live.\r\nYou've got an abundance of beaches, shops, cafes, restaurants, supermarkets and community activities all within a short distance from the property. And Kensington Park offers a heated pool, gym, and sauna, vege plots, petanque courts, a mini putt golf green and 10 acres of beautifully maintained park-like grounds.\r\nA property in a place where every day feels like a holiday, but with all the comforts of home.\r\n\r\nConjunctions welcome!\r\nPlease call Tim for more information.",
